KG42.register("edges-fba71706ff2345af6081eee7",{"id":"S-7325b69ae15c10e3","source":"KG31-623d45f464e9bce4","type":"links","target":"COMP-6ea6fa7e2454dda5","evidence_class":"S","scientific_acceptance":false,"relation_scope":"original_occurrence_pair_only","internal_to_parent":false,"paper_ids":["11-p2p_mechanisms_evaluation"],"assertions":[{"id":"11-p2p_mechanisms_evaluation::v141-c-R010::E::v141-c-R010-E001","paper":"11-p2p_mechanisms_evaluation","rule_id":"v141-c-R010","rule_ref":"11-p2p_mechanisms_evaluation::v141-c-R010","record":{"edge_id":"v141-c-R010-E001","source":"coordination.local_operator","target":"settlement.payment","type":"links","constraint_ids":["v141-c-R010-C001"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-e05"]},"evidence_class":"S","provenance_gate":"direct_C_edge_with_constraint_and_source_excerpt","scientific_acceptance":false,"accepted_constraint_ids":["v141-c-R010-C001"],"held_constraint_ids":[],"semantic_review_status":"supported","source":"KG31-623d45f464e9bce4","target":"COMP-6ea6fa7e2454dda5","source_occurrence_id":"11-p2p_mechanisms_evaluation::v141-c-R010::V::coordination.local_operator","target_occurrence_id":"11-p2p_mechanisms_evaluation::v141-c-R010::V::settlement.payment","source_unit_id":"11-p2p_mechanisms_evaluation::v141-a-M01::coordination.local_operator","target_unit_id":"11-p2p_mechanisms_evaluation::v141-a-M01::settlement.payment","omega":{"market_type":"LEM","network_level":null,"jurisdiction":null,"pricing_scope":null,"time_scale":null,"participant_types":[],"trading_stage":"settlement","context_text":"P2P energy-sharing framework within an energy sharing region. | Practical settlement deadline discussed in support of the last-defence mechanism. | The paper's last-defence mechanism for iterative P2P energy sharing.","unknown_fields":["network_level","jurisdiction","pricing_scope","time_scale","participant_types"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-e05","v141-b-g02-e19","v141-b-g03-E15"]},"active":true,"source_signature":"c3fe337cfa64bae8e9cb72af96a9cd5c8fb8ab7cb224108a2fce7688f18fe329","relation_scope":"original_occurrence_pair_only","internal_to_parent":false,"source_science":{"mechanism_id":"v141-a-M01","source_definition":"Requested quantities represented in the SDR energy-bid profile are submitted to the local coordinator at every iteration. Scope: SDR iterative submission of signed net-energy profiles within an energy sharing region. Condition: The submitted profile contains a nonnegative net-energy bid at the relevant time step. Offered quantities represented in the SDR energy-bid profile are submitted to the local coordinator at every iteration. Scope: SDR iterative submission of signed net-energy profiles within an energy sharing region. Condition: The submitted profile contains a negative net-energy bid at the relevant time step. The coordinator must provide and operate the trading platform and its associated metering mechanisms. Scope: Coordinator infrastructure obligations in the described local P2P framework. The coordinator does not control devices directly and applies unified rules fairly to all participants. Scope: Coordinator intervention under the paper's heuristic convergence techniques. Condition: When the heuristic techniques interfere with participants' control of their devices. Handling physical-network problems such as overvoltage and congestion is outside the coordinator's modeled remit and is deferred to further research. Scope: Limits of the coordinator's modeled remit in the studied P2P framework.","target_definition":"The coordinator provides and operates the billing mechanisms associated with the trading platform. Scope: P2P energy-sharing framework within an energy sharing region. Trades are settled using the status at the last iteration, retaining P2P energy sharing on that basis. Scope: The paper's last-defence mechanism for iterative P2P energy sharing. Condition: The maximum number of iterations is reached without convergence. Trading is settled at the deadline at which the bidding and pricing iteration has to stop. Scope: Practical settlement deadline discussed in support of the last-defence mechanism. Condition: The deadline for the bidding and pricing iteration is reached.","constraints":[{"constraint_id":"v141-c-R010-C001","kind":"procedural","role":"core","statement":"The coordinator provides and operates the billing mechanisms associated with the trading platform. Scope: P2P energy-sharing framework within an energy sharing region.","expression":null,"formalization_origin":"not_formalized","template_id":null,"members":["coordination.local_operator","settlement.payment"],"variable_refs":[],"parameter_refs":[],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-e05","v141-b-g02-e04"]}],"evidence":[{"evidence_id":"v141-b-g01-e05","location":{"location_id":"src-d485825b0d-p04-c2r3__v141-a-M01-coordination","page":4,"printed_page":"996","section":"3.1","anchor_text":"gy sharing paradigm d P2P energy sharing paradigms. P2P energy sharing can be carried out among pros","equation_id":null,"figure_id":null,"table_id":null,"image_ref":"pages/page-04.png","occurrence_role":"definition"},"source_text":"P2P energy sharing can be carried out among prosumers in a microgrid or a part of distribution network (referred to as \"energy sharing region (ESR)\" in this paper), supervised by a market operator (named \"energy sharing coordinator\", short as \"coordinator\", in this paper). A coordinator is usually needed in P2P energy sharing practice due to two reasons. First of all, a coordinator is needed to specify the rules for trading and supervise the energy sharing activities. The rules include the core pricing model and implementation process, as well as other relevant rules to guarantee the interests of every participant. Secondly, a trading platform as well as the associated metering and billing mechanisms needs to be provided and operated by a coordinator, based on which P2P energy sharing is able to be conducted."},{"evidence_id":"v141-b-g02-e04","location":{"location_id":"src-d485825b0d-p04-c2r3__v141-a-M01-coordination","page":4,"printed_page":null,"section":"3.1","anchor_text":"gy sharing paradigm d P2P energy sharing paradigms. P2P energy sharing can be carried out among pros","equation_id":null,"figure_id":null,"table_id":null,"image_ref":"pages/page-04.png","occurrence_role":"definition"},"source_text":"P2P energy sharing can be carried out among prosumers in a microgrid or a part of distribution network (referred to as “energy sharing region (ESR)” in this paper), supervised by a market operator (named “energy sharing coordinator”, short as “coordinator”, in this paper). A coordinator is usually needed in P2P energy sharing practice due to two reasons. First of all, a coordinator is needed to specify the rules for trading and supervise the energy sharing activities. The rules include the core pricing model and implementation process, as well as other relevant rules to guarantee the interests of every participant. Secondly, a trading platform as well as the associated metering and billing mechanisms needs to be provided and operated by a coordinator, based on which P2P energy sharing is able to be conducted."}],"omega":{"market_type":"LEM","network_level":null,"jurisdiction":null,"pricing_scope":null,"time_scale":null,"participant_types":[],"trading_stage":"settlement","context_text":"P2P energy-sharing framework within an energy sharing region. | Practical settlement deadline discussed in support of the last-defence mechanism. | The paper's last-defence mechanism for iterative P2P energy sharing.","unknown_fields":["network_level","jurisdiction","pricing_scope","time_scale","participant_types"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-e05","v141-b-g02-e19","v141-b-g03-E15"]},"source_record":{"edge_id":"v141-c-R010-E001","source":"coordination.local_operator","target":"settlement.payment","type":"links","constraint_ids":["v141-c-R010-C001"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-e05"]},"paper_scope_note":"SDR, MMR, and BS are kept separate; the A18 net quantity differs from the A24 independent component; optional step-size control and the divergent loop in the example are not treated as general convergence or necessary dependencies."}}],"assertion_ids":["11-p2p_mechanisms_evaluation::v141-c-R010::E::v141-c-R010-E001"]});
